{
  "key": "sound/kit-boombap-mpc60",
  "kind": "sound",
  "summary": "Akai MPC60 kit for boom-bap and lo-fi: fat kick, crunchy snares, closed and open hat, clap, rim",
  "tags": [
    "boom bap",
    "boom-bap",
    "lofi",
    "lo-fi",
    "hip hop",
    "MPC",
    "90s",
    "kit",
    "drums",
    "dusty"
  ],
  "devices": [
    "Playfield"
  ],
  "links": [
    "pattern/boombap-1",
    "sound/kit-boombap-sp12",
    "genre/boom-bap",
    "genre/lofi-hip-hop"
  ],
  "checked": {
    "how": "written",
    "by": "claude (style kits)",
    "date": "2026-11-24",
    "opendaw": "652e6ca"
  },
  "body": [
    "The Akai MPC60's 12-bit drums, the boom-bap sound: loud dry kick and snare, swung hats (pattern/boombap-1). For lo-fi, play it quieter and add production/lofi.",
    "Apply makes a new drum track (it never replaces the old one): park the old drums (mute) at the bar the new kit starts. Pads are named by role, so drum patterns and evolve_notes find them; samples (the tool) finds other sounds to swap in with make_kit."
  ],
  "apply": {
    "params": {
      "pattern": {
        "type": "text",
        "optional": true,
        "about": "a knowledge drum pattern for it to play from the start (\"pattern/trap-2bar\"); leave out for an empty kit"
      },
      "from_bar": {
        "type": "number",
        "optional": true,
        "about": "the timeline bar its region starts on (loop off: the next bar line after it lands)"
      },
      "bars": {
        "type": "number",
        "optional": true,
        "about": "how many bars it runs (loop off: to the song's end)"
      },
      "name": {
        "type": "text",
        "optional": true
      }
    },
    "steps": [
      {
        "op": "kit",
        "input": {
          "name": "$name",
          "default_name": "MPC Kit",
          "volume_db": -3,
          "pads": [
            {
              "role": "kick",
              "sample": "AkaiMPC60/bd/0 Bassdrum"
            },
            {
              "role": "snare",
              "sample": "AkaiMPC60/sd/Snare 2"
            },
            {
              "role": "closed_hat",
              "sample": "AkaiMPC60/hh/Closed Hat"
            },
            {
              "role": "open_hat",
              "sample": "AkaiMPC60/oh/Open Hat"
            },
            {
              "role": "clap",
              "sample": "AkaiMPC60/cp/Clap"
            },
            {
              "role": "rim",
              "sample": "AkaiMPC60/rim/Rim Gated"
            },
            {
              "role": "ride",
              "sample": "AkaiMPC60/rd/Ride"
            }
          ],
          "notes": {
            "of": "$pattern",
            "from_bar": "$from_bar",
            "bars": "$bars"
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
